  "readme": {
    "available": true,
    "excerpt": "dsh-change-budget gives every DeepSeek Harness Agent turn a configurable budget for structured file mutations. It counts distinct files, mutation calls, and submitted UTF-8 bytes before supported tools run—then rejects the first call that would cross a limit."
